{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats","id":1215777,"title":"Compiling a full list of 2e playable Splats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-06T07:27:06-07:00","id":1215777,"title":"Compiling a full list of 2e playable Splats","content":"Changelings (Contracts, Pledges, Opening Doors to the Hedge, Kith and Seeming blessings, Hedgespinning, Onieromancy, Changeling Merits, Motley merits, Wyrd)<br /> Prometheans (Transmutations, Lightning heals them)<br /> Fae Touched (Contracts, limited Pledges, with merit limited Onieromancy, Fae Touched Merits, maybe Motley Merits)<br /> Vampires (Kindred) (Heal or Enhance physical traits by spending vitae, Displines, Blood Sorcery, Ghouls, Vampire Merits)<br /> Mages (Scour the Form, Spells)<br /> Werewolves (Gifts, Shapeshifting, Werewolf Merits, Rapid healing)<br /> Proximi (Limited access to spells)/<br /> Demons (Demon Form, Enbeds, Ciphers, Explots, Covers, Pacts, Demon merits)<br /> Beasts (Horrors, Beast Merits, Avatisms, Nightmares, Kinship Merits, Epic/Advanced Merits, Lairs, Primordial Pathways)<br /> Heralds (Beast not Igidam Heralds) (Kinship Merits and Advanced/Epic Merits)<br /> Nephilim (usual Demon blooded stuff?)<br /> (Demon Blooded) Fractals (Supernatural Merits, Embeds, Cipher, Unseen Sense merit)<br /> (Demon Blooded) Offspring (Supernatural Merits, Embeds, Cipher, Unseen Sense merit)<br /> Immortal (Blood Bathers) (Immortality, various advantages depending on type of blood bathing ritual)<br /> Spirits (Numina, Influences, Rank, Manifestations)<br /> Dhampyr (Blood Sorcery, Dooms)<br /> (Vampire) Reverants (Displines,Heal by spending vitae, Reverant Merirs)<br /> Ghouls (Displines, Heal by spending Vitae, Ghoul Merits)<br /> Wolf Blooded (Tells)<br /> Lost Boy (Lost Boy merits)<br /> Dreamer (Dreamer merits)<br /> Psychic Vampire (Psychic Vampire merits)<br /> Lucky (Lucky merits)<br /> Plain (Plain merits)<br /> Supernatural Merit Mortals (Supernatural Mortal merits)<br /> Hedge Denizen Hobgoblins (Goblin Contracts, Goblin Bargains, easier travel in the Hedge, and switch your goblin contracts at dawn)<br /> Former Hedge Denizen Mortal (limited access to Goblin Contracts)<br /> Goblin Queen Hobgoblins (Goblin Contracts, Goblin Bargains, easier travel in the Hedge, and switch your goblin contracts at dawn, Hobgoblin Retainers)<br /> Sorcerers (Open and maybe closed rites)<br /> Infected (Infected Merits)<br /> Stigmatics (Supernatural Merits)<br /> (Demon Blooded) Latents (Unseen Sense: The God-Machine and a Stigmata. They can also buy some of the Demon-Blooded Merits such as Infrastructure Proficiency, Instinctive Deflection, and the modified Language and Multi-Lingual Merits.)<br /> Skin Changers (Shape Shifters)<br /> Body Thieves (Immortal, Body Switchers)<br /> <br /> Not sure if humans with the Goblin Queen and Hedge Denizen count as a splat and Fetch are sort of playable (really just spend your xp to raise your Changelings Wyrd and your raises automatically and you gain an echo).<br /> <br /> <br /> Up coming: Hunters, Bound, Ghosts, Mummies, Deviants<br /> <br /> Did I forget any 2e playable splats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","user":"Omegaphallic","date":". 05-07-2018, 10:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T08:26:38-07:00","id":1215799,"title":"","content":"Changelings and Fae-touched are still in Previews and may change.<br /> <br /> Please give Prometheans the dignity of their full name<br /> <br /> And I'd say &quot;Supernatural Merits&quot; is Mortals, with Supernatural Merits as their semi-exclusive powers<br /> <br /> Oh, and don't forget the Infected, Skin Takers and Open Rite Sorcerors<br /> <br /> Also, do you want to include fansplats?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":7920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","user":"Master Aquatosic","date":". 05-06-2018, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T10:39:49-07:00","id":1215848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215799#post1215799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Changelings and Fae-touched are still in Previews and may change.<br /> <br /> Please give Prometheans the dignity of their full name<br /> <br /> And I'd say &amp;quot;Supernatural Merits&amp;quot; is Mortals, with Supernatural Merits as their semi-exclusive powers<br /> <br /> Oh, and don't forget the Infected, Skin Takers and Open Rite Sorcerors<br /> <br /> Also, do you want to include fansplats?</div> </div> </div> </div> I think anyone can be Open Rite sorcerers, but I could be wrong, I'll double check.<br /> <br /> And I don't plan on listing fan splats this is more an list of official splats.<br /> <br /> And while Changelings and Fae Touched might have some revisions, they will continue to exist so I'm still counting them.<br /> <br /> Infected I'll add to the list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T11:04:00-07:00","id":1215855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215848#post1215848\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think anyone can be Open Rite sorcerers, but I could be wrong, I'll double check.</div> </div> </div> </div>Only living beings. Sure, it's not not a template, but it is still less than &quot;everyone&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T11:08:07-07:00","id":1215857,"title":"","content":"Proximi-What are these again?<br /> Offspring-Same question<br /> Immortal (Blood Bathers)-what book are they updated in?<br /> Lost Boy-Same question as Immortal<br /> Dreamer-Same<br /> Psychic Vampire-same<br /> Lucky-Same. I know i've read some of these somewhere, but which books am i forgetting to open to read these splat rules?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T11:24:38-07:00","id":1215865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManBearPig</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215857#post1215857\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Proximi-What are these again?<br /> Offspring-Same question<br /> Immortal (Blood Bathers)-what book are they updated in?<br /> Lost Boy-Same question as Immortal<br /> Dreamer-Same<br /> Psychic Vampire-same<br /> Lucky-Same. I know i've read some of these somewhere, but which books am i forgetting to open to read these splat rules?</div> </div> </div> </div> Proximi are people with limited access to Supernal magic, often runs in families, less powerful then mages, and they have a curse they are under. <br /> <br /> Offspring are people who have a demon parent or who have taken one of their parents as cover. Half Demons basically. <br /> <br /> Fractuls are the children of two demons. <br /> <br /> Bloodbathers are from the Dark Eras Companion. <br /> <br /> Lucky, Pyschic Vampire, Plain, Lost Boy, Dreamers, Infected are all from the book Hurt Locker.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T13:05:37-07:00","id":1215875,"title":"","content":"So Proximi are Mage, Offspring are demon(that I just seem to have skimmed over in...HtoH probably?), I remember reading about Fractals, Blood Bathers in Dark Eras Companion(Still havent gotten around to really getting into my pdf of that one) and I forgot there was stuff in the hurt locker besides merits and gear! lol. So focused on just a few pages, couldnt see the forest. Thank you Omegaphallic!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T13:23:31-07:00","id":1215881,"title":"","content":"Offspring, Latents and Fractals are all different types of Demon-Blooded. Then there's also the Stigmatics that share most of the base set of features with Demon-Blooded.<br /> Funnily, Stigmatics starts with three extra Merit dots like all the major templates (except that they have to be spent on Supernatural Merits exclusively) while the much more involved Demon-Blooded don't. They also don't necessarily have access to any Supernatural Merits at all (except the Unseen Sense common to all Demon-Blooded).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T16:09:57-07:00","id":1215920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215881#post1215881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Offspring, Latents and Fractals are all different types of Demon-Blooded. Then there's also the Stigmatics that share most of the base set of features with Demon-Blooded.<br /> Funnily, Stigmatics starts with three extra Merit dots like all the major templates (except that they have to be spent on Supernatural Merits exclusively) while the much more involved Demon-Blooded don't. They also don't necessarily have access to any Supernatural Merits at all (except the Unseen Sense common to all Demon-Blooded).</div> </div> </div> </div>They get Embeds, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T16:21:54-07:00","id":1215921,"title":"","content":"They do, but the extra Merit dots are heavily associated with major templates so I still find it a bit weird that only the lesser of the minor Demon templates gets that advantage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T17:50:27-07:00","id":1215940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManBearPig</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215875#post1215875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So Proximi are Mage, Offspring are demon(that I just seem to have skimmed over in...HtoH probably?), I remember reading about Fractals, Blood Bathers in Dark Eras Companion(Still havent gotten around to really getting into my pdf of that one) and I forgot there was stuff in the hurt locker besides merits and gear! lol. So focused on just a few pages, couldnt see the forest. Thank you Omegaphallic!</div> </div> </div> </div> Your welcome!<br /> <br /> Anyways yeah Latents, Fractals, and Offspring are all demon blooded, but different kinds of demon blooded, Latents only superpower as it is is the possiblity they could turn into offspring or give birth to offspring, so I didn't include them, but I guess I should. Same with Stigmatics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T17:53:09-07:00","id":1215942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215881#post1215881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Offspring, Latents and Fractals are all different types of Demon-Blooded. Then there's also the Stigmatics that share most of the base set of features with Demon-Blooded.<br /> Funnily, Stigmatics starts with three extra Merit dots like all the major templates (except that they have to be spent on Supernatural Merits exclusively) while the much more involved Demon-Blooded don't. They also don't necessarily have access to any Supernatural Merits at all (except the Unseen Sense common to all Demon-Blooded).</div> </div> </div> </div> Actually I believe that Stigmatics are unique in that unlike other supernatural templates they can still take Mortal Supernatural Merits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T18:00:43-07:00","id":1215945,"title":"","content":"Are Nepilim a thing in demon the descent or did I confuse things on that one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-06T20:33:28-07:00","id":1215976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215945#post1215945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are Nepilim a thing in demon the descent or did I confuse things on that one?</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon Storyteller's Guide. And yes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T02:23:54-07:00","id":1216016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1215940#post1215940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Your welcome!<br /> <br /> Anyways yeah Latents, Fractals, and Offspring are all demon blooded, but different kinds of demon blooded, Latents only superpower as it is is the possiblity they could turn into offspring or give birth to offspring, so I didn't include them, but I guess I should. Same with Stigmatics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Latents explicitly has Unseen Sense: The God-Machine and a Stigmata. They can also buy some of the Demon-Blooded Merits such as Infrastructure Proficiency, Instinctive Deflection, and the modified Language and Multi-Lingual Merits.<br /> They can also buy Embeds despite not starting with any. I do find that a bit weird, but the book says &quot;All Demon-Blooded can learn Embeds.&quot; Similarly, they also start with a Cipher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T03:29:32-07:00","id":1216027,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1216016#post1216016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Latents explicitly has Unseen Sense: The God-Machine and a Stigmata. They can also buy some of the Demon-Blooded Merits such as Infrastructure Proficiency, Instinctive Deflection, and the modified Language and Multi-Lingual Merits.<br /> They can also buy Embeds despite not starting with any. I do find that a bit weird, but the book says &amp;quot;All Demon-Blooded can learn Embeds.&amp;quot; Similarly, they also start with a Cipher.</div> </div> </div> </div> I might pick up Heirs to Hell later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T04:11:33-07:00","id":1216036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1216016#post1216016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Latents explicitly has Unseen Sense: The God-Machine and a Stigmata. They can also buy some of the Demon-Blooded Merits such as Infrastructure Proficiency, Instinctive Deflection, and the modified Language and Multi-Lingual Merits.<br /> They can also buy Embeds despite not starting with any. I do find that a bit weird, but the book says &quot;All Demon-Blooded can learn Embeds.&quot; Similarly, <b>they also start with a Cipher</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Latents do not. They only get Stigmata and Unseen Sense (God-Machine). Oh, and all Demon-Blooded can take Supernatural Merits, explicitly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T05:51:14-07:00","id":1216061,"title":"","content":"All Demon-Blooded have Ciphers. Latents just lack the Condition for the first Key. For that they need to become Offspring. So their Cipher is inaccessible until they become Offspring, but it's already there. It's not the process of becoming an Offspring that creates the Cipher.<br /> <br /> &quot;Demon-blooded characters have access to Supernatural <br /> Merits (pp. 298-302 of Demon: The Descent), <i>at the <br /> Storyteller\u2019s discretion</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Unlike Stigmatics who starts with Supernatural Merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T06:07:14-07:00","id":1216069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1215777-compiling-a-full-list-of-2e-playable-splats?p=1216036#post1216036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Latents do not. They only get Stigmata and Unseen Sense (God-Machine). Oh, and all Demon-Blooded can take Supernatural Merits, explicitly.</div> </div> </div> </div> this makes me wonder which minor splat is the the most powerful.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T06:27:07-07:00","id":1216075,"title":"","content":"I think Deviants should be mentioned in the Upcoming section, but for now only a couple of things from Dark Eras have been left off. Immortal (Body Thieves) from DEC and Skinthieves from DE1 are not on the list.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-07T06:30:48-07:00","id":1216080,"title":"","content":"Actually, it's technically possible for a Latent to start unlocking their Cipher without becoming Offspring by using an Embed and failing the Compromise roll. It's even specified that Latents use the Compromise rules, and the primary purpose of those are the advancement (or backtracing) of the Demon-Blooded Cipher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}